\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Wall-chamber decomposition of the peg-preserving parameter space $\Theta _{\mathrm  {peg}}$ projected to the $(\rho , \delta )$-plane, drawn as a schematic illustration of the chamber/wall geometry. Continuous walls $W_1$ (backing-ratio, red) and $W_2$ (oracle-deviation, green) carve out four smooth chambers in this projection; the discrete triggers $W_3$--$W_6$ are annotated as external events, and the two further continuous walls $W_7$ and $W_8$ act on coordinates outside the $(\rho ,\delta )$ plane and are not drawn.}}{13}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
